# Sebaka Majacode — Backend & Database

Supabase PostgreSQL schema and Edge Functions for user authentication and email verification.

---

## Project Structure

````text
sebaka_majacode/
├── supabase/
│   ├── config.toml                  # Supabase local project configuration
│   ├── migrations/
│   │   └── 001_schema.sql           # Database tables, indexes, and RLS policies
│   └── functions/
│       ├── _shared/
│       │   └── cors.ts              # Shared CORS headers for Edge Functions
│       ├── send-code/
│       │   └── index.ts             # Generates and sends email verification codes
│       └── verify-code/
│           └── index.ts             # Validates submitted verification codes
└── .gitignore
